    """
    Edit the existing product (ID 2799) and ensure:
    - Price = 60 (Prices tab)
    - Size = S (General tab, if present)
    - Color = Blue (General tab, if present)
    - Inventory Qty = 50 and Stock Availability = In Stock (Inventory tab)
    - Save the product (final action)

    All interactions use accessibility-centric selectors (get_by_role, get_by_label, select_option, check, fill, click).
    No knowledge-base helper functions are available in the environment.
